# =============================================================================
# .gitignore - Sistem Penyewaan Perlengkapan Outdoor / Camping
# Hanya menyertakan source code C++ (.h, .cpp) dan dokumentasi proyek (README.md)
# =============================================================================

# Materi Perkuliahan & Dokumen Panduan Tugas Besar (Lokal Saja)
materi/
rules/
*.pdf

# File Konfigurasi AI & Panduan Agen Lokal
AGENTS.md
GEMINI.md

# File Kompilasi & Binary Executable
*.exe
*.o
*.obj
*.out
*.dll

# Direktori & File Konfigurasi IDE / Editor
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.tmp
*.log

# File OS / Environment
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
